\">&nbsp;2013-1학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 종합시험 과목을 붙임과 같이 공지하오니 기한 내 응시원서를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 응시 신청 기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 03. 25(월) ~ 03. 28(목)[4일간]</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 응시 신청 방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #a8c40d\" color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faed7d\" color=\"#000000\"><strong>원스톱서비스 로그인→학사관리→졸업→종합시험응시신청</strong></font></span></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #a8c40d\" color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">※ 종합시험 응시 신청 후 반드시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">지도교수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">을 받으셔야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 유의사항 1 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 시험은 동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(불합격 과목 응시자는 합격한 내용 확인 후 시험 응시 신청하여야 함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;ex) 석？박사과정 모두 문제 출제 교수가 반드시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2명</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 이상이어야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 과목수를 학기별로 나누어 시행할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 박사는 4과목, 석사는 3과목 모두 신청하셔야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (대학원 학위수여 규정 제2장 제5조 4항)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">다. 과목별 합격자의 경우 종전 불합격한 과목 외 다른 과목으로도 응시할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 유의사항 2 : 본인 학과(전공)에서 출제된 과목 외에는 응시할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><img class=\"txc-emo\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/things_20.gif?rv=1.0.1\">&nbsp;첨부&nbsp; 2013-1학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 종합시험 과목 각 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LI